# M3 — Catalogue (plan 14 §2): "A store manager creates and publishes a course, a book and a cause through the API;
# public endpoints serve them with ETags; the seed catalogue appears."
# Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development): PASSED — steps run from S-09.http, then:
#  1. manager@smoke.test (store_manager) created smoke-course, smoke-book (print + digital) and smoke-cause   ✅
#  2. all three published (publish checks: cover, price/formats, cause target)                               ✅
#  3. /v1/catalog/products/{slug} → 200 with a weak ETag for every published product (15 seed + 2 new)       ✅
#  4. smoke-book archived → public 404; the draft stays 404 publicly while /preview is 200                    ✅
#  5. goal seed 1500.00/12 on smoke-cause visible on the public page and live figures                         ✅
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1/catalog

### Seed catalogue + new products
GET {{base}}/products?pageSize=50

### New course, with ETag
GET {{base}}/products/smoke-course

### Conditional request → 304
GET {{base}}/products/smoke-course
If-None-Match: W/"<etag from the previous response>"

### New cause (goal seed visible)
GET {{base}}/products/smoke-cause

### Archived book → 404
GET {{base}}/products/smoke-book
